00:39:17.207 --> 00:39:18.825
Thank you guys.

00:39:18.825 --> 00:39:20.583
- We love you guys, we'll be right back.

00:39:20.583 --> 00:39:21.903
- [Ross] Amazing.

00:39:21.903 --> 00:39:24.486
(upbeat music)

