00:40:25.139 --> 00:40:26.895
It what?

00:40:26.895 --> 00:40:28.312
- [Ross] Uh Drew.

00:40:29.267 --> 00:40:31.772
(audience cheering)

00:40:31.772 --> 00:40:32.605
Oh.

00:40:34.275 --> 00:40:35.108
What ah!

