00:41:05.412 --> 00:41:07.439
- That is so sweet.
- Hollywood lot.

00:41:07.439 --> 00:41:08.398
- Hello.

00:41:08.398 --> 00:41:10.215
That is so sweet.

00:41:10.215 --> 00:41:13.132
